reading: a negative 'capped_RAS vs uncapped_RAS' mean difference = the cap alone already improves RAS; a negative 'model vs capped_RAS' mean difference = the covariate-informed learned prior adds reconstruction accuracy BEYOND the cap. If model vs capped_RAS is ~0, the synthetic win is essentially all cap, and Section 5.2/5.4 must say so.
